Third-party regulatory material
-------------------------------
This package references clause numbers and summaries from publicly issued
documents, including:
  - FDA guidance: Predetermined Change Control Plans for ML-Enabled Devices
  - 21 CFR 807.81(a)(3)
  - ICH Q12 (Post-approval Change Management Protocol, chapter 4)
  - UN Regulation No. 156 (SUMS / RXSWIN)
  - Regulation (EU) 2024/1701; EU AI Act Article 43(4); EU MDR
  - NMPA announcements 2025/63, 2025/119, 2023/108; SAMR Order No. 47
  - IMDRF N90 (Essential Principles and Content of PCCPs)

Only clause identifiers, short paraphrases and links are included. No regulatory
text is reproduced in full. Copyright in those documents remains with the issuing
authorities. Clause anchors were audited against primary sources; see ANCHORS.md,
which also records two citations that were downgraded for insufficient support.

